                                                "sense_id": "55c1e647-705d-35c7-b5c8-d9b6b1aa8d6a",
                                                "text": "Man introduces reason into the world of Nature, destroying irrational struggle and waste. But this activity is outside of self, distant, only reflected. Man sees this irrationality only with his intellect."
